<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-UHISLIISING H1 PROFIT NINE MILLION KROONS.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-UHISLIISING H1 PROFIT NINE MILLION KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uhisliising, the leasing arm of the Uhispank group, said on Tuesday that its first half year profit was nine million kroons.</p>
<p>In a short statement, the company said that its balance sheet after the first six months of 1997 was 750 million kroons.</p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202/1 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
